{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-message-p7469","chapterId":"s46d546a995957fbf","language":"ja","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-message-p7469-54d88d9ecbaa3feba15a","text":"写真を撮ったらウチに見せてね～","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-3e56cada38f56d185f66","text":"（写真を見せる）","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-689989b066849696db5b","text":"ウチ、こんな写真撮ってたんだ！めっちゃ面白いじゃん！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-40ae4aa31a728d227f99","text":"撮り直してくれてありがとう、[開拓者]！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-8310b1c011074a65ed28","text":"{F#私}{M#俺}も面白いと思う","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-30877aa9791311065939","text":"{F#私}{M#俺}も写真撮影が面白くなってきた","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-a7095fed1f82e10c782d","text":"でしょでしょ、アンタもわかってきたんだね～","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-12eddd70a8d026ba49c6","text":"もっと報酬が欲しい","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-49d188c123151b86136b","text":"報酬は弾んで{F#くれるよね}{M#くれるよな}","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-6f32d5ff093fc9363973","text":"アンタ、欲張りすぎじゃない！？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-9f4d76d463c9e5bdc8aa","text":"わかった…損はさせないから","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-36db77dd046087c2a471","text":"残りの写真もお願いね。じゃあ、明日も撮影よろしく！","speaker":""}]}
